{
  "version": "0.6.6",
  "notes": "Live cross-device sync and automatic updates: open phone and desktop clients now refresh the shared chat automatically about every 1.5 seconds, so messages sent on one device appear on the other without reloading. The shared XemAi server now checks the official verified update channel automatically, waits for active replies to finish, installs updates once centrally, restarts safely, and both clients detect the new server version and reload themselves. This release also switches the updater back to a full-program manifest so skipped versions can jump straight to the current release safely.",
